  "description": "Beautifully Presented 3-Bed, 2-Bath Home – Castleview Drive, Swords\n\nStewart Real Estate is delighted to present this excellent three-bedroom, two-bathroom property in the popular Castleview development in Swords.\n\nRecently refurbished and presented in excellent condition, this home offers bright and comfortable accommodation and would make an ideal long-term home.\n\nThe property comprises of two spacious double bedrooms and one single bedroom, together with two brand-new refurbished bathrooms, both fitted with showers.\n\nThe accommodation also benefits from a newly fitted kitchen, gas-fired central heating and a sunny rear garden, providing a lovely outdoor space to enjoy. There is also parking available to the front.\n\nProperty Features\nThree bedrooms\nTwo double bedrooms\nOne single bedroom\nTwo brand-new refurbished bathrooms\nBoth bathrooms fitted with showers\nNew kitchen\nGas-fired central heating\nSunny rear garden\nParking available to the front\nExcellent residential location\nLong-term tenancy sought\nLocation\n\nCastleview Drive is ideally positioned within the established Swords area, with a wide range of everyday amenities close by.\n\nApplewood Village is within easy reach and provides a range of shops and services, while Swords town centre and the Pavilions Shopping Centre offer extensive shopping, restaurants, cafés, leisure facilities and other amenities.\n\nNearby schools include Thornleigh Educate Together National School, Swords Educate Together National School and Gaelscoil Bhrian Bóroimhe. Broadmeadow Community National School and Swords Community College are also in the wider area.\n\nTransport & Commuting\n\nThere are excellent public transport links serving the area, including Swords Express services providing direct connections towards Dublin city centre, together with Dublin Bus routes including the 41C, 41X and 43.\n\nThe property is also conveniently located for commuters with easy access to the M1 and M50 motorways, Dublin Airport, and the wider north Dublin area.\n\nSwords Business Park, The Campus Swords and Airside Business Park are all within the wider Swords employment area.\n\nLong-Term Let\n\nThis property is being offered to the market seeking a long-term tenant.\n\nEarly viewing is highly recommended.",
